{% set listedNpcs = whileYouWereAwayNpcs or [] -%}
{% from "_includes/while-you-were-away-update-schema.njk" import characterUpdateSchema %}
{% include "_includes/while-you-were-away-prose-guidance.njk" %}

{% if listedNpcs | length -%}
The following NPCs are currently at this location and have not been with the player continuously since the player last saw them. Here's where they were last seen and how long ago:
{% for npc in listedNpcs -%}
- {{ npc.name }} (last seen {{ npc.lastSeenTimeAgo }} at {{ npc.lastSeenLocationName | default(npc.last_seen_location, true) }})
{% endfor -%}

<task>Write a paragraph-long summary for each listed character, if any, describing what they have been up to since they last saw the player.
{% if whileAwayVisibleProseRequired -%}
This arrival has no other narration. You MUST include non-empty proseForPlayer describing what the player directly sees, learns, or experiences on returning. Do not treat the movement notice as prior arrival prose.
{% else -%}
Include proseForPlayer only when there is useful player-facing return narration that has not already been covered. Otherwise omit proseForPlayer or leave it empty.
{% endif -%}</task>

If one of the above listed characters was already here when the player arrived, keep them in their listed update. Only use the optional arrival section for a character who is physically in the exact current location right now but was not listed above. Do not use it for someone who is merely nearby, elsewhere in the same building, or audible from another room.

Need bar instructions:{% for bar in needBarDefinitions or [] %}
- {{ bar.id }}: {{ bar.while_you_were_away_prompt_notes | eval }}
{% endfor %}

These instructions take precedence over existing game state descriptions, which described the characters at the time they were last seen and are not intended to lock characters in that state. Even if a character is narratively 'starving,' if food is available in the scene, their food bar should be at least 50%, etc.
{% else -%}
No current-location NPCs require individual while-you-were-away character updates.
{% if whileAwayVisibleProseRequired -%}
This arrival has no other narration. You MUST include non-empty proseForPlayer describing what the player directly sees, learns, or experiences on returning. Do not treat the movement notice as prior arrival prose.
{% else -%}
Include proseForPlayer only when there is useful player-facing return narration that has not already been covered. Otherwise omit proseForPlayer or leave it empty.
{% endif -%}
{% endif -%}

Return a response in this format:

<response>
{% if whileAwayVisibleProseRequired -%}
  <!-- proseForPlayer is mandatory and must contain player-facing arrival narration. -->
{% else -%}
  <!-- proseForPlayer is optional. Omit it or leave it empty when its trimmed content would be empty. -->
{% endif -%}
  <proseForPlayer>
    <!-- New return information from the player's perspective only, following the non-repetition rules above. When optional, omit this element or leave it empty if everything was already covered by the immediately preceding player-action response in this turn. -->
  </proseForPlayer>
  <characterUpdates>
    {% for npc in listedNpcs -%}
    {{ characterUpdateSchema(npc.name) }}
    <!-- Use one needBarEffect per applicable bar, or empty needBarChanges when none apply. Omit travelDestination when they stayed here. -->
    {% endfor -%}

    {% if listedNpcs | length -%}<!-- Optionally, if any character who is NOT listed above ARRIVED at this location since the player was last here, you can include them here like this: -->{% else %}<!-- If any character not already in the party ARRIVED at this location since the player was last here, include them here as below. OMIT all party current party members, but otherwise check the prose against the game state and make sure the game state is updated to match. -->{% endif -%}
    {{ characterUpdateSchema('Exact existing arriving character name', true) }}
    <!-- HERE means physically at this exact current location. Use one needBarEffect per applicable bar, or empty needBarChanges when none apply. -->

    <!-- Repeat as necessary for arriving characters -->
    
    <!-- If there are no listed characters and no exact-location arrivals, leave characterUpdates empty. -->
  </characterUpdates>
  <itemSceneryMoves>
    <!-- Did any items or scenery move along with the player/party from their previous location to this one? If so, list their exact names here. Check the prose against the game state to ensure accuracy. -->
    <itemName><!-- Exact name of the item or scenery that moved --></itemName>
    <!-- Repeat for each item or scenery that moved -->
  </itemSceneryMoves>
</response>
